### 3.3 `src/hooks/use-scans.ts` — Surface Edge Function Failures

**Current state:** Lines 127–131 call `supabase.functions.invoke("analyze-url", ...)` fire-and-forget. The `.catch()` only logs to `console.error`. The user sees nothing.

