## Sequencing and Dependencies

The phases are largely independent but have some ordering constraints:

1. `index.css` changes (2.1) must happen before the component token changes (2.2-2.6) — the new CSS vars must exist before components reference them.
2. `use-debounce.ts` (1.5) must be created before it's imported in admin pages.
3. `ChartErrorBoundary.tsx` (4.3) must be created before it wraps Recharts in Dashboard.
4. The `MIN_PASSWORD_LENGTH` constant (3.3) can go in `constants.ts` at any time.
5. `useSyncExternalStore` in `AgentWorkspace.tsx` (1.2) is independent of all other changes.

